{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>In a path.</b> As the Targum renders: בִּשְׁבִיל. And likewise ״אִם יִשְׂפֹּק עֲפַר שֹׁמְרוֹן לִשְׁעָלִים״ (I Kings 20) — the dust that clings to the soles of the feet as they walk. And likewise ״מִי מָדַד בְּשָׁעֳלוֹ מַיִם״ (Isaiah 40) — with his feet, in his walking." "<b>A wall from this side and a wall from that side.</b> An unspecified גָּדֵר is of stones."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:13.838576357Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}